# Each bench tool's binary is also ignored where `go build` drops it by
# default -- next to its own main package. The root-anchored entries above
# only cover `go build -o <name>` run from the repo root, which let
# bench/shgen/shgen (4.5MB, and carrying the build machine's Go toolchain
# paths) reach the public repo.
